    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "catharsis sounds like a lot of work though. like, why do i have to sit here and suffer through the ugly parts just to feel something? it feels more like just being a victim to the decay. it’s like being forced to watch a movie you hate until the very last frame just because it's technically \"happening.\"",
