      "content": "but \"letting things be\" doesn't stop the feeling of being stuck in it. it feels so much more dignified to leave on your own terms before everything is completely unrecognizable and ruined. like, why is there this pressure to just endure the misery until it finishes you off? wouldn't it be more peaceful to just step away while there's still a piece of yourself left?",
